# MBS.SC P8-D -- runtime operational flag directory.
#
# Bind-mounted READ-ONLY into scanner-manager at /run/mbs. An operator toggles the
# platform-wide private-scanning kill switch by creating or removing:
#
#   infra/runtime/EMERGENCY_DISABLE_PRIVATE_SCANNING
#
# Existence = private scanning DISABLED, effective within ~5s with NO manager restart.
# The sentinel itself is git-ignored; this file only keeps the mount point in the tree.
